# Debug
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# Arceus state — selectively committed.
# Design artifacts under .arceus/changes/ and .arceus/config.json are
# git-trackable so teams can review AI plans via PR. Runtime state
# (notepad, session logs, preflight markers) is filtered out by the
# nested .arceus/.gitignore that `arceus init` writes per project.
.arceus/*
!.arceus/.gitkeep
!.arceus/.gitignore
!.arceus/changes/
!.arceus/config.json
